{"answer_text":"Use one pipeline per sales motion (new business, expansion, partners), share stage definitions, and report across all of them. Tools that handle multiple pipelines well:\n\n**Halcyon Sales**\nCombines cadences, dialer and pipeline in one place.\n\n**Tallyfox**\nMultiple pipelines per workspace and a clean deal timeline; forecasting is basic but accurate for small books of business.\n\n**Kestrel CRM**\nAuto-logs emails and meetings to deals, so pipelines stay current.\n\nPick Halcyon Sales for breadth, or Tallyfox if you want something your reps will adopt faster.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50cf-73c1-8978-db16378ddce8","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.006,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:01:06.850Z","engine":"google_ai_mode","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["multiple sales pipelines best practice","crm multiple pipelines reporting"],"latency_ms":12030,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a2eb448ab7","market_name":"Canada","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889c3d4225fd","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":null,"method":"alias","name":"Halcyon Sales","name_text":"Halcyon Sales","offsets":[[173,186],[469,482]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a264dfde4e61","homonym":false,"is_subject":true,"list_rank":null,"method":"alias","name":"Tallyfox","name_text":"Tallyfox","offsets":[[245,253],[499,507]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"self","sentiment":"neutral","sentiment_reason":"Listed factually without praise or criticism."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-5864-7406-ad9e-7a386e391e3e","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":null,"method":"llm","name":"Kestrel CRM","name_text":"Kestrel CRM","offsets":[[382,393]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment